@startuml
title SSAD — Change Analysis Workflow

start
:Define Change Request;
:Build Change Surface;
:Check Boundary and Ownership Impact;
:Check Data and Interface Impact;
:Check Component and Technology Impact;
:Check Trust / Failure / Recovery Impact;
:Update Acceptance and Traceability;
:Verify affected knowledge;

if (Unknown or contradiction remains?) then (yes)
  :Classify OPEN or revisit upstream decision;
else (no)
  :Restore Stable state;
endif

stop
@enduml
